note bottom of RequestStatusService
  All request status writes go through this class.
  Outbox/audit/history are staged and committed with one SaveChangesAsync.
end note

note bottom of DecisionGateCloseCaseAdapter
  DEV2 composition only: delegates to the shared M3 contract
  with RecommendationType.CloseCase and the request as target.
  It contains no decision lookup or approval logic.
end note

note bottom of UnavailableCloseCaseDecisionGate
  Retained as the fail-closed fallback. Member 3 must implement
  and register the real IDecisionGate; Member 1 currently
  registers DenyAllDecisionGate.
end note

note bottom of LocalFileStore
  Cms.Application.Contracts.IFileStore also exists with a different signature.
  Member 1 must confirm which interface is canonical before freeze.
end note

